      {
        "id": 228924,
        "name": "“Mad Dog”",
        "username": "_Mad_Dog",
        "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/_mad_dog/{size}/4859_2.png",
        "created_at": "2019-10-13T20:36:08.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>The first time I played this one-shot, I won with Friction lost in the \"Unforgiving Wasteland\".&nbsp; After seeing Frivyeti's post, I wondered if I could win with all four villains lost in the \"Unforgiving Wasteland\".</p>\n<p>Yes, yes I could.</p>\n<p>Thanks to Frivyeti for the idea.</p>\n<p>PS<br>\nJust realized, in the second game where I played to get all villains taken out by the environment, that the heroes actually ended the game healthier than in the first play-through where I was just trying to win.&nbsp; Funny old world, eh?</p>",
        "post_number": 7,
        "post_type": 1,
        "updated_at": "2021-02-07T06:03:32.199Z",
        "reply_count": 0,
        "reply_to_post_number": null,
        "quote_count": 0,
