        "can_wiki": false,
        "read": false,
        "user_title": null,
        "bookmarked": false,
        "raw": "<p>The first time I played this one-shot, I won with Friction lost in the \"Unforgiving Wasteland\".&nbsp; After seeing Frivyeti's post, I wondered if I could win with all four villains lost in the \"Unforgiving Wasteland\".</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Yes, yes I could.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Thanks to Frivyeti for the idea.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>PS<br />\r\nJust realized, in the second game where I played to get all villains taken out by the environment, that the heroes actually ended the game healthier than in the first play-through where I was just trying to win.&nbsp; Funny old world, eh?</p>",
